{"title":"AI & Tech Networking Event in Toronto by Ascent Valley","startsAt":"2026-11-10T19:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-10T22:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join founders, investors and tech talent at this curated **startup networking event in Toronto.**\n\nMeet ambitious builders, exchange ideas and discover new opportunities in a dynamic community environment.\n\n**RSVP: [Use this link](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ai-tech-networking-event-in-toronto-by-ascent-valley-tickets-1999720403558?aff=oddtdtcreator)**\n**Please note that RSVP is managed via Eventbrite to control attendee lists — don’t ignore it to avoid issues with on-site payment.**\n\n**🚀 Meet investors, founders, AI experts, operators, and immigrant entrepreneurs building the next generation of global companies.**\n\n* Share your project and get feedback.\n* Connect with capital.\n* Expand your network.\n* This is where conversations turn into partnerships.\n* Use our participant mini app to keep every contact and insight from the event — nothing gets lost.\n\n👥 Who You’ll Meet\n• Startup Founders\n• Angel Investors & VC firms\n• AI Experts\n• Entrepreneurs from Europe, Asia & the UK\n• Marketers, Sales leaders & Business Advisors\n• Builders & Game Changers\n\nStartup Pitch Session\nSelected founders take the stage for a focused 5-minute presentation in front of active investors and tech leaders.\nEach startup receives:\n⚡ Professional evaluation\n⚡ Investor feedback\n⚡ Visibility inside our global ecosystem\n\n**Why You Can’t Miss It**\n• Meet Tech & Business professionals, founders, and active investors\n• Gain real feedback from venture capitalists and angel investors\n• Discover new opportunities in AI, Tech & early-stage startups\n• Build meaningful connections in a global entrepreneurial community\nIf you’re serious about startups — you should be in the room.\n\n📈 Want to Pitch?\nSend your deck to:\n📧 events@ascentvalley.club or fill [form](https://ascentvalley.com/pitch)\nLimited spots. Curated selection.\n\n🏆 The startup recognized as “Most Investment-Worthy” will be featured across our social media and included in our investor newsletter.\n\n**🌟 About Ascent Valley**\n\n[Ascent Valley ](https://ascentvalley.com/infrastructure \"https://ascentvalley.com/infrastructure\")is a global ecosystem connecting founders, innovators, and investors.\nWe believe great ideas shouldn’t stay hidden — they deserve to be heard, challenged, and supported by the right people.\nOur mission is to create environments where ambitious builders connect, collaborate, and grow together.","venue":{"name":"Blood Brothers Brewing","address":"165 Geary Avenue, Toronto","lat":43.66985,"lng":-79.436195,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Startup Networking & Founder Ecosystem | Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/1/f/highres_535976095.jpeg"}